{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 54 levels while strategically placing and directing chess pieces to break open all present treasure chests on a given chess board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique chess board with holes, walls, and more to navigate around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces can't be fully controlled, as they will continue in whichever direction you set them off in, so be sure to think before placing and directing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game pieces will be introduced, starting at pawns, then  rooks, bishops, and knights. There can be pieces of both colors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the quirks of the movements and interactions of pieces and tiles?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894290?t=1756980873","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894290?t=1756980873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894290/774c2fef2da262eed824671548308905b96ecc06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756980873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894290/774c2fef2da262eed824671548308905b96ecc06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756980873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 54 levels while strategically placing and directing chess pieces to break open all present treasure chests on a given chess board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique chess board with holes, walls, and more to navigate around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces can't be fully controlled, as they will continue in whichever direction you set them off in, so be sure to think before placing and directing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout th